    {
      "t": "html",
      "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">virtual auto Read (<a class=\"cppref\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/size_t\" title=\"cppreference.com (C++17)\">std::size_t</a> recommended_number_bytes_to_return, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_diag_MetaInfo_818707.html\">MetaInfo</a> const &amp;meta_info, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_diag_CancellationHandler_e2b2ab.html\">CancellationHandler</a> cancellation_handler) noexcept -&gt; <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Future_420ba8.html\">ara::core::Future</a>&lt; <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Vector_53b788.html\">ara::core::Vector</a>&lt; <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_core_ara_core_e30e31.html#SWS_CORE_04200\">ara::core::Byte</a> &gt; &gt;=0;</pre>",
      "tail": "\n"
    },
    {
      "t": "html",
      "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Reads data chunk from the application. The first or subsequent file/directory info content chunk to be sent back to the UDS client will be composed by the application and its ownership is passed as a result to <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_diag_ara_diag_fbd60d.html\">ara::diag</a>.</p></div>",
      "tail": "\n"
